<title>UK: Tordom prices $250 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Tordom prices $250 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager IBJ, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TORONTO DOMINION BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.75	MATURITY	 JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.335   PAY DATE    13.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.71     SPREAD	+21 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    US/UK/CA</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ONTARIO/CANADA		     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.625 PCT APRIL 2002 UST</p>
